[265.1446, "o", "  23:13Z coderabbitai: ** Major** · Functional Correctness · Quick win Use decimal multipliers for \r\n`M` and `G`.\r\n"]
[265.1446, "o", "  23:48Z Jont828: Fixed in 418a77b3f27b7810d179a21a7d253aa171f92a76: `M` and `G` are now \r\n"]
[265.1446, "o", "`Decimal(1000) ** 2` and `Decimal(1000) ** 3`, so `parse_quantity(\"1M\") == 1000\r\n"]
[265.1449, "o", "  23:49Z coderabbitai: `@Jont828` Verified in `418a77b`: `M` and `G` use powers of 1000, and the \r\nthree regression cases are present. I did not run the tests. ---\r\n"]
